**/snapshots/**
**/keys
**/keys/**
**/data
**/data/**
**/maps
**/maps/**
**/v1-*.bin
**/device.json
**/camera.json
**/service-token
**/*credentials*
**/*secret*
**/*private-key*
**/*camera-pin*
**/motion-hold.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
